<%- include('header') %><section class="section claim-layout"><div class="claim-intro"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR INVITATION TO A LITTLE LUXURY</div><h1>Good looks.<br><em>Golden perks.</em></h1><p>Leave your details and get a personal coupon for up to ₹<%= settings.discount %> off an eligible salon service.</p><ul class="benefits"><li>✦ A unique coupon, made just for you</li><li>✦ Valid for <%= settings.validity %> days from issue</li><li>✦ Limited to the first 100 customers</li></ul><div class="real-stats"><span class="dot"></span><strong><%= stats.recent %> <%= stats.recent===1?'person has':'people have' %></strong> applied in the last 24 hours.<small><%= stats.total %> of 100 coupons claimed · Based on actual applications</small></div><p class="muted">One welcome coupon per mobile number. No cash value. Cannot be combined with other offers. Discount cannot exceed the service bill.</p></div><div class="form-card"><div class="eyebrow">A FRESH LOOK IS ONE STEP AWAY</div><h2>Claim your coupon</h2><p>Just a few details. Then it’s yours.</p><% if(error){ %><p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><% if(stats.total>=100||!offers.length){ %><p>The current coupon allocation is closed. Call <a href="tel:+919126691868">9126691868</a> for available promotions.</p><% }else{ %><form method="post" action="/claim" id="lead-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Your name <span>*</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="Your full name"></label><label>Mobile number <span>*</span><div class="mobile-input"><b>+91</b><input type="tel" name="mobile" autocomplete="tel-national" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[6-9][0-9]{9}" maxlength="10" required placeholder="10-digit mobile number"></div></label><label>What are you interested in? <span>*</span><select name="service" required><option value="">Choose a service</option><% services.forEach(s=>{ %><option><%= s.name %></option><% }); %></select></label><label>When would you like to visit? <span>*</span><select name="timeframe" required><option value="">Choose a timeframe</option><option value="5">Within 5 days</option><option value="7">Within 7 days</option><option value="10">Within 10 days</option></select></label><label>Your offer<select name="offer" required><% offers.forEach(o=>{ %><option value="<%= o.id %>" <%= o.id===selected?'selected':'' %>><%= o.title %></option><% }); %></select></label><label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>I agree to the <a href="/privacy">terms and privacy policy</a> and allow the salon to contact me about this coupon.</span></label><button class="button wide" type="submit">Generate my golden coupon →</button><small>Your details stay with the salon. No public customer list.</small></form><% } %></div></section><%- include('footer') %>
